# Color scheme (source of truth)

**Reference image:** `Documentation/images/color-scheme.jpg`  
**Brand sheet origin:** Axiforma + green / teal identity (Rich Black → Caribbean Green → Anti-Flash White).

When the user shares a **sample / screenshot / reference UI**, rebuild layout and hierarchy from the sample, but **map every color to this scheme**. Do not invent new brand hues (no sky-blue primary, purple, terracotta, cream broadsheet). Prefer Tailwind tokens over raw hex.

## Typography

| Role | Spec |
|------|------|
| Brand face | **Axiforma** (Regular / Medium / Semi Bold) when licensed files are available |
| Web fallback | `Manrope` via `next/font` (geometric sans close to Axiforma) |
| UI | Same family app-wide; Semi Bold ≈ headings, Medium ≈ emphasis, Regular ≈ body |

