| `primary-500` | Caribbean Green | `#00DF81` | Bright accent, focus ring, highlights on dark |
| `primary-600` | Bangladesh Green | `#03624C` | **Primary CTA** (white label) |
| `primary-700` | Forest | `#095544` | CTA hover / pressed |
| `primary-800` | Basil | `#0B453A` | Strong text on light tint |
