## Surfaces (light / dark)

| Context | Light | Dark |
|---------|-------|------|
| App background | `bg-gray-50` (`#F1F7F6`) | `dark:bg-gray-950` or `dark:bg-gray-900` (`#020F11` / `#032221`) |
| Card / panel | `bg-white` or `bg-gray-50` + `border-gray-200` | `dark:bg-gray-800` (`#06302B`) + `dark:border-gray-700` |
| Modal brand bar | `from-primary-700 to-primary-600` | same |
| Overlay | `bg-black/50` | same |
| Branded list cards | `bg-brand-sky` + `brand-ink` tab | **keep meadow + ink** (do not gray-wash) |

`gray-*` is **green-tinted** in `tailwind.config.js` so existing `gray-50`…`gray-900` classes follow the brand automatically.

## Text

| Role | Light | Dark |
|------|-------|------|
| Primary | `text-gray-900` / `text-brand-ink` | `dark:text-gray-50` |
| Secondary | `text-gray-500` / `text-brand-stone` | `dark:text-gray-300` |
| On CTA (`primary-600`) | `text-white` | `text-white` |
| On dark / ink | `text-brand-antiFlash` or `text-white` | — |
| On `brand-sky` card | title `text-brand-ink`, muted `text-brand-ink/65`, header meta `text-white` | same |
| Link / emphasis | `text-primary-700` | `dark:text-primary-400` / `dark:text-brand-caribbean` |

## Semantic (ledger)

| Meaning | Light | Dark |
|---------|-------|------|
| Credit / positive | `text-primary-700` or `text-green-800`, badge `bg-primary-100 text-primary-800` | `dark:text-primary-400` / caribbean |
| Debit / negative | `text-red-700`, badge `bg-red-100 text-red-800` | `dark:text-red-400` |
| Danger actions | red (`formModalDangerButtonClass`) | same |
| Demo banner | amber / yellow (unchanged) | same |

Prefer **brand greens for credit** when touching money UI so credit matches the palette; keep **red for debit** (do not use brand green for losses).

## Mapping samples → this scheme

1. Keep structure from the sample.
2. Sample blues / old sky UI → `primary-*` / `brand-sky` / `brand-ink`.
3. Sample neon greens → `primary-500` / `brand-caribbean`.
4. Sample dark backgrounds → `gray-900` / `brand-rich` / `brand-pine`.
5. Sample cream / purple / orange themes → reject; remap to this green system.
6. Focus: `focus-visible:ring-primary-500` (click rings suppressed in `globals.css`).

## Do not

- Reintroduce the old blue primary (`#0ea5e9` family) as brand.
- Add a second unrelated brand hue.
- Hardcode one-off hex without updating `tailwind.config.js` **and** this rule + the scheme image.

## Token files

- `tailwind.config.js` + `demo-mode/tailwind.config.js` (keep identical)
- `Documentation/images/color-scheme.png` (visual swatch sheet for humans)
